        <UserObject label="" mermaidData="{&#xa;  &quot;data&quot;: &quot;flowchart TB\n\n%% ===== Users =====\nsubgraph Users\n    HU[Household User]\n    WU[Worker User]\n    AU[Admin User]\nend\n\n%% ===== Presentation Layer =====\nsubgraph Presentation[\&quot;Presentation Layer\&quot;]\n    F[Flutter Mobile App&lt;br/&gt;Screens &amp; Widgets]\n    R[React / Vite Admin Dashboard&lt;br/&gt;Pages &amp; Components]\nend\n\n%% ===== Application Layer =====\nsubgraph Application[\&quot;Application / State Layer\&quot;]\n    SF[Screen Flow]\n    FV[Form Validation]\n    SR[Selected Role]\n    SW[Selected Worker]\n    SS[Service Filters]\n    BS[Booking UI State]\n    AG[Agreement Display State]\n    PR[Payment Receipt State]\n    DS[Dispute Status State]\nend\n\n%% ===== Service Layer =====\nsubgraph Services[\&quot;Service Layer\&quot;]\n    AUTH[Authentication Service]\n    PROF[Profile Service]\n    SEARCH[Search Service]\n    BOOK[Booking Service]\n    AGREEMENT[Agreement Service]\n    PAYMENT[Payment Tracking Service]\n    DISPUTE[Dispute Service]\n    REVIEW[Review Service]\n    NOTIFY[Notification Service]\n    ADMIN[Admin Service]\nend\n\n%% ===== Data Layer =====\nsubgraph Data[\&quot;Data Layer\&quot;]\n    CLIENT[Supabase Client Libraries]\n    DB[(Supabase PostgreSQL)]\n    STORAGE[(Storage Buckets)]\nend\n\n%% ===== External Services =====\nsubgraph External[\&quot;External Services\&quot;]\n    AUTHAPI[Supabase Authentication]\n    PUSH[Push Notification Service]\n    EASY[EasyPaisa / JazzCash]\nend\n\n%% ===== User Connections =====\nHU --&gt; F\nWU --&gt; F\nAU --&gt; R\n\n%% ===== Presentation to Application =====\nF --&gt; SF\nF --&gt; FV\nF --&gt; SR\nF --&gt; SW\nF --&gt; SS\nF --&gt; BS\nF --&gt; AG\nF --&gt; PR\nF --&gt; DS\n\nR --&gt; SF\nR --&gt; FV\n\n%% ===== Application to Services =====\nSF --&gt; AUTH\nFV --&gt; AUTH\nSR --&gt; AUTH\n\nSW --&gt; SEARCH\nSS --&gt; SEARCH\n\nBS --&gt; BOOK\nAG --&gt; AGREEMENT\nPR --&gt; PAYMENT\nDS --&gt; DISPUTE\n\n%% ===== Internal Service Relations =====\nBOOK --&gt; AGREEMENT\nBOOK --&gt; PAYMENT\nBOOK --&gt; DISPUTE\n\nBOOK --&gt; REVIEW\nBOOK --&gt; NOTIFY\nADMIN --&gt; DISPUTE\nADMIN --&gt; PAYMENT\nADMIN --&gt; AGREEMENT\n\n%% ===== Services to Data =====\nAUTH --&gt; CLIENT\nPROF --&gt; CLIENT\nSEARCH --&gt; CLIENT\nBOOK --&gt; CLIENT\nAGREEMENT --&gt; CLIENT\nPAYMENT --&gt; CLIENT\nDISPUTE --&gt; CLIENT\nREVIEW --&gt; CLIENT\nNOTIFY --&gt; CLIENT\nADMIN --&gt; CLIENT\n\nCLIENT --&gt; DB\nCLIENT --&gt; STORAGE\n\n%% ===== External Connections =====\nAUTH --&gt; AUTHAPI\nPAYMENT -.-&gt; EASY\nNOTIFY -.-&gt; PUSH\n\nAUTHAPI --&gt; DB\nDB --&gt; STORAGE&quot;,&#xa;  &quot;config&quot;: null&#xa;}" id="oVPiYozWABMjdSOOR1ry-1">
